# Frontend packages

Follow `.cursor/skills/frontend-packages/SKILL.md`.

- Units live in `@bga/components`, `@bga/pages`, `@bga/hooks`, `@bga/utils` — one folder each, local `index.ts` only.
- No package-wide barrel; no `export *` / `import *`.
- Named exports only (Next `page.tsx` / `layout.tsx` may default-export a named page adapter).
- Components, hooks, utils have co-located tests; pages do not.
